<title>ITALY: Italy's Dini sees President Scalfaro, no details.</title>
<headline>Italy's Dini sees President Scalfaro, no details.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro had talks with Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini on Wednesday, his office said in a statement.</p>
<p>As is customary, no details of the meeting were released.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
